===Etymology 1===
{{etymon|en|id=final|:inh|enm:laste<id:finally>}}
From {{inh|en|enm|laste}}, {{m|enm|latst}}, syncopated variant of {{m|enm|latest}}, both ultimately from {{inh|en|ang|latost}}. {{dbt|en|latest}}.

